T1  - Psychophysiological assessment of trauma-focused Group Music and Imagery therapy for women with PTSD or CPTSD using script-driven imagery. A randomised controlled study.
AU  - Rudstam, Gabriella
AU  - Elofsson, Ulf O.E.
AU  - Söndergaard, Hans Peter
AU  - Beck, Bolette D.
JO  - European Journal of Trauma & Dissociation
VL  - 7
