T1  - Transcutaneous Auricular Vagus Nerve Stimulation as a Potential Novel Treatment for Preoperative Anxiety: A Narrative Literature Review
AU  - Hu, Xia
AU  - Zhao, Yuting
AU  - Tian, Lin
AU  - Zhu, Yanan
JO  - Journal of PeriAnesthesia Nursing
PY  - 2026
DA  - 2026/07/15/
