T1  - Can music influence cardiac autonomic system? A systematic review and narrative synthesis to evaluate its impact on heart rate variability
AU  - Mojtabavi, Helia
AU  - Saghazadeh, Amene
AU  - Valenti, Vitor Engrácia
AU  - Rezaei, Nima
